abstract: >-
  Python workflows and aggregate tables for vertical-datum harmonisation,
  sea-level and historical-water-level preparation, connected-inundation
  screening, population-exposure calculation, trend sensitivity and
  levelling/InSAR quality control in the Pearl River Estuary.
